    "scope": "29 already public research slots listed in order plus each of the 3 geographic protocol variants, 2 of which stayed below the source floor. Conservative Bonferroni multiplication by 96 applies to the full-vs-U.S., full-vs-training incidence and full-vs-coin paired comparisons. Other unregistered exploration was not enumerated, so no field-wide discovery claim.",
    "uncertainty": "Fixed 3 sequential test-target moving blocks, 10,000 resamples, deterministic original OFR LCG from e6248d83. Two-sided descriptive 95% percentiles. This enforces the explicit 3-target specification at n=30; the older generic helper chooses length 4 at this size. Secondary one-sided paired loss improvement is tested by enumerating all 2^10 sign flips of ten disjoint 3-target blocks under independent/equiprobable block signs. Report raw and multiplied p-values. Stronger serial dependence can invalidate that assumption. With 1024 permutations, the minimum 96-fold-adjusted p is 0.09375, so neither this sensitivity nor the short retrospectively built sample can establish a family-wide 5% discovery. Keep the registered economic gate visibly separate."
